# Channel design of Block 04 - what stays out of GitHub
# 1. generated intermediates of the plan-profile sheet pipelines (regenerated by run_all.py / export_pdf.py; tile caches)
**/sewergems/sheets/scripts/IMG/
**/sewergems/sheets/scripts/DXF/
**/sewergems/sheets/scripts/PDF/*.pdf
**/sewergems/sheets/scripts/PDF/Combined/
**/sewergems/sheets/scripts/PDF/_chk/
**/sewergems/sheets/scripts/view_frames/
**/sewergems/sheets/archive/
# 2. editor and tool droppings
__pycache__/
*.pyc
Thumbs.db
~$*
.~lock*
*.lock
*.dwl
*.dwl2
*.bak
**/civil3d/Backup/
